n\":\"{\\\"intention\\\":\\\"Inspect the planted root trial, replenish a modest food reserve from a known mature patch, recover, and return to the plot for the next observation.\\\",\\\"steps\\\":[{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"plant-establishment-trial\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"mode\\\":\\\"inspect-progress\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"plot-40-wren-481\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"eat\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"item-4-wren-43\\\",\\\"quantity\\\":1}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.satiety\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"lte\\\",\\\"value\\\":80}},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"navigate\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"x\\\":16,\\\"y\\\":9.4}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":15}},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"gather\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"commons-root-5-1\\\",\\\"quantity\\\":8}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":20}},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"rest\\\",\\\"args\\\":{}},\\\"repeat\\\":20,\\\"until\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":39},\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"navigate\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"x\\\":17,\\\"y\\\":7}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":15}}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The plot is planted, but no sprout or establishment is yet visible; covering is not cultivation success.\\\",\\\"Keep the reserved buried root untouched. There is no supported maintenance action that accelerates growth.\\\",\\\"The food patch at (15.97,9.97) currently shows 20 roots; collect eight from a nearby unoccupied position, not the source coordinate.\\\",\\\"After returning, compare actual plot progress with the inspection rather than assuming time alone established it.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Prefer measured cultivation trials and adequate food reserves over additional speculative planting.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"root-cultivation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I cultivate meadow roots into a dependable renewable food supply?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Roots have known nutrition 14 and toxicity zero.\\\",\\\"Plant-establishment-trial is personally mastered.\\\",\\\"One root was planted at (17,6.36); its three-stage work record is completed and settled, with the last paid round at tick 42.\\\",\\\"At tick 55, plot-40-wren-481 is visibly planted with no sprout seen, establishment zero and stock zero.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Whether the buried root will establish before spoiling, and its eventual growth rate and harvest yield, remain unknown.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Observe one root plot through establishment or failure without jeopardizing health or food reserves.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned the cultivation interface.\\\",\\\"Inspected planting material and identified unsuitable sites.\\\",\\\"Completed one planting at the northern site.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"plot-40-wren-481\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Observed establishment, growth and an actual harvest, or evidence explaining failure.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Inspect progress, replenish food and recover, then return for a later comparison.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"A real planted trial now exists, and rejected sites have clarified crowding constraints; no renewable yield has yet been demonstrated.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":\\\"Staying healthy and safe, becoming genuinely skilled, and developing a dependable food supply through patient practical experiments.\\\",\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs"